   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8fe18",
   "off": 589336,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "主人をかばって\r大男がモンスターと\r戦っている\u0010\b",
   "en": "A huge man was fighting monsters, shielding his master.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8fe48",
   "off": 589384,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "すぐれた戦士のようだが\rさすがに 苦戦している\rようだ\u0010\b",
   "en": "He seemed a fine warrior, but even he was hard-pressed.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8fe7f",
   "off": 589439,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "フィンとリスプは加勢した\u0010",
   "en": "Finn and Risp joined the fight.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8fe9a",
   "off": 589466,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8fea4",
   "off": 589476,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "フィンは傷ついた老人を\r助け起こした\u0010\b",
   "en": "Finn helped the wounded old man to his feet.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8fecf",
   "off": 589519,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "プレリアール\r",
   "en": "Prairial\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8fede",
   "off": 589534,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「どなたか知らんが感謝する\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"I know not who you are, but you have my thanks.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8fefc",
   "off": 589564,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  突然､化け物どもが\r  地下室から…\u0010\b  グレイストーンと共に\r  地下室へいってくれ！\u0010\b",
   "en": "Without warning, the creatures came up from the cellar...\u0010\bGo down to the cellar with Greystone, I beg of you!\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8ff51",
   "off": 589649,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  私は大丈夫だ\r  生き残った部下達を\r  集めて立て直す」\u0010",
   "en": "I shall be fine. I will gather what men survived and regroup.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES16:8ff99",
   "off": 589721,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "何もないようだ\u0010",
   "en": "There seems to be nothing here.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
